WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
You've already built an audience.
But what have you built around your name?

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.700
I started MintedScale
with one clear idea:

3
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:12.760
to help you build a real, long-term brand
and business around your audience.

4
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.900
Today you can offer a program, a course,

5
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.380
premium content or a completely new service,

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.200
but from the start, it mattered to me

7
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:25.000
not to build something that lasts
one campaign or one launch.

8
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.680
I want you to have a digital product
you can use and grow for years.

9
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:33.260
That's why we build an app under your name.

10
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.200
We shape it around your identity,

11
00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.280
your content
and what your audience really needs.

12
00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:43.700
As your idea grows,
the app grows with it.

13
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:47.700
Your app. Your content. Your brand.

14
00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.620
Today it might hold one program
or premium content;

15
00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:56.500
tomorrow a membership, a new service,
or something you haven't imagined yet.

16
00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.000
What matters is that every new idea

17
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:02.500
already has a home
your audience knows.

18
00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:05.100
But building the app
is only part of the job.

19
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.660
So alongside the product,
we plan how it reaches your audience.

20
00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.220
We work out how to present it.

21
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.200
We shoot the teaser and announcements.

22
00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:17.200
We prepare the launch content
and run production and marketing.

23
00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:21.200
Every video, every message, every shot

24
00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:25.700
should show why the product exists
and who it's for.

25
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.980
You pay nothing upfront for any of this.

26
00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.180
At the start, we agree
on a percentage of sales.

27
00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.740
We build the app
and lead its launch.

28
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.040
And you're probably wondering
when we get paid.

29
00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:43.500
We only earn once the product
starts making money.

30
00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.700
When you earn, we earn.

31
00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:49.400
One of the key parts of MintedScale

32
00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.660
is the AI system I built

33
00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:54.200
to help you understand
how your audience reacts.

34
00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:58.900
When you post a video on TikTok,
Instagram or YouTube,

35
00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:03.480
the system can analyse the available data
on your content:

36
00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:06.500
where attention drops,
what keeps people watching

37
00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.760
and which topics and formats work best.

38
00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:13.960
It then turns that data into clear
daily and weekly reports

39
00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:17.100
you can use
to plan your next posts.

40
00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.560
At the end of the day, you already have
the hardest thing to build:

41
00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.080
your audience's attention and trust.

42
00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:28.940
MintedScale adds product, technology,
production, marketing and analytics.

43
00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.500
That's how we build a system
around your name

44
00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:35.890
that can grow with you
for years.

45
00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.450
We don't just make a program.

46
00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:41.370
We build a digital business
around your name.

47
00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:45.100
If you want to see what this
could look like for your brand,

48
00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:48.650
send us your profile
through the form below.

49
00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:50.300
Can't wait to hear from you!
